OL,3,AFormer German spy chief arrested for
OL,4,Aespionage and treason
OL,5,
OL,6,FProsecutors allege that he used
OL,7,Fclassified intelligence to "draft an
OL,8,Fanalysis" for one foreign intelligence
OL,9,Fservice and maintained contact with
OL,10,Fanother foreign spying service.
OL,11,FInvestigators have not disclosed which
OL,12,Fforeign powers were involved.
OL,14,FPolice also arrested former BND
OL,15,Femployee Manfred D, accusing him of
OL,16,Fpassing Hanning about 2,000 classified
OL,17,Fdocuments for money.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
